{"id":"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["58-df-primitive-recursive","58-df-PR"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md]]","[[58-df-composition-operator]]","[[../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-primitive-recursive</span><span>58-df-PR</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2ef5ac555fe2963\" href=\"?note=a2ef5ac555fe2963\" title=\"58-df-composition-operator\">58-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"886d3e2a93a3e218\" href=\"?note=886d3e2a93a3e218\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S : \\omega \\to \\omega\">\\(S : \\omega \\to \\omega\\)</span> (后继函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x) = x+1\">\\(S(x) = x+1\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n : \\omega^n \\to \\omega\">\\(\\pi_i^n : \\omega^n \\to \\omega\\)</span> (投影函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n(\\vec{x}) = x_i\">\\(\\pi_i^n(\\vec{x}) = x_i\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S\\)</span> (复合算子谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a2ef5ac555fe2963\" href=\"?note=a2ef5ac555fe2963\" title=\"58-df-composition-operator\">58-df-composition-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\\)</span> (显式记录目标元数的原始递归算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"886d3e2a93a3e218\" href=\"?note=886d3e2a93a3e218\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,n,f\\in V\">\\(C,n,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S\\)</span> (predicate for families closed under the primitive-recursive schemes, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\\)</span> (primitive-recursive-function predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{PRClosed}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(z,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;(z(\\vec x)=0)\\to z\\in C\\right)\\right)\\land \\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,S(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\in C\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall i\\in k\\;(\\pi_i^k\\in C)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\;\\forall\\vec g\\in(C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^n})^m\\;\\forall c\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S(c,h,\\vec g,n,m)\\to c\\in C)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{n-1}}\\;\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{n+1}}\\;\\forall u\\in\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\;(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n(g,h)=u\\to u\\in C)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{PRClosed}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow C\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(z,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;(z(\\vec x)=0)\\to z\\in C\\right)\\right)\\land \\{\\langle\\langle x\\rangle,S(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\in C\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall i\\in k\\;(\\pi_i^k\\in C)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^m}\\;\\forall\\vec g\\in(C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^n})^m\\;\\forall c\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S(c,h,\\vec g,n,m)\\to c\\in C)\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{n-1}}\\;\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^{n+1}}\\;\\forall u\\in\\omega^{\\omega^n}\\;(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n(g,h)=u\\to u\\in C)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S(C)\\to f\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S(f,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land \\operatorname{Function}(f,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{PRClosed}_S(C)\\to f\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> denotes the union over arities of the functions satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveRecursive}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The recursion closure now calls the registered arity-indexed operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_n\\)</span>; omitting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> did not determine the target function type.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 包含所有初等算术函数（加法、乘法、指数等）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 是全函数类（处处有定义）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR} \\subsetneq \\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR} \\subsetneq \\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>（真包含于递归函数类）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a> — 递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"fff5dc780f29d486\" href=\"?note=fff5dc780f29d486\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md\">../batch13/58-df-zero-function.md</a> — 零函数&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a> — 后继函数&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md</a> — 投影函数&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[